@startuml
title Sequence diagram

actor User
participant "Engagement" as Engagement #purple
participant "Party Interaction" as PartyInteraction #red
participant "Digital Identity" as DigitalIdentity #red
participant "Party" as Party #red
participant "Party Roles&Permissions" as PartyRoles #red

== USER LOGS IN; User Data and Role obtained ==

User -> Engagement : 1. Access Quotation Page
Engagement -> PartyInteraction : 2. **TMF701 Process Flow**\nPOST /processFlow (processFlowSpecification=Quote_PageWelcome,\nchannel="B2B eCommerce Portal")
activate PartyInteraction

note over PartyInteraction
  task 1 "Initial Step selection by user":
  create new Interaction id
  (**TMF683 Party Interaction**)
  return configured list of Actions:
  Sign In, Sign Out,
  Redirect to main portal
end note

PartyInteraction --> Engagement : 3. **TMF701 Process Flow**\n201 Created (processFlow.id=1,\nprocessFlowSpecification=Quote_PageWelcome,state=active,taskflow.id=1.1,\n//Identify Yourself, Create Your Account, Redirect to main portal//)

Engagement -> Engagement : 4. Display Choice for user

User -> Engagement : 5. Selected: Sign In
Engagement -> PartyInteraction : 6. **TMF701 Process Flow**\nPATCH processFlow/1/taskFlow/1.1\n(characteristic("Sign In selected"))

note over PartyInteraction
  task 1 "Initial Step selection by user":
  update Interaction item
  (**TMF683 Party Interaction**)
  completed
  task 2 "Trigger Collect User Data and Role", active
end note

PartyInteraction -> DigitalIdentity : 7. **TMF701 Process Flow**\nPOST /processFlow\n(processFlowSpecification=CollectUserDataAndRole,\ncallback when information provided(processFlow.id=1,taskFlow.id=1.2))
activate DigitalIdentity

note over DigitalIdentity : task 1 "Check Credential", hold

DigitalIdentity --> PartyInteraction : 8. **TMF701 Process Flow**\n201 Created (processFlow.id=2,state=active,taskFlow.id=2.1,state=hold\n//TaskTask Flow Information Required: login, password//)

PartyInteraction --> Engagement : 9. 200 OK (callback when information provided(processFlow.id=2,taskFlow.id=2.1\n//TaskTask Flow Information Required: login, password//))

Engagement --> User : 10. Redirect to Login page

User -> Engagement : 11. Submit login form
Engagement -> PartyInteraction : 12. **TMF701 Process Flow**\nPATCH processFlow/2/taskFlow/2.1\n(characteristic(login, password))
PartyInteraction -> DigitalIdentity

note over DigitalIdentity
  task 1 "Check Credential"
  check credential and get DI.id
  (**TMF720 Digital Identity**)
  task 2 "Get Digital Identity"
  get DI record, PartyRole.id, IndividualIdentified.id
  (**TMF720 Digital Identity**)
  opt: task 3 "Get Individual"
  get Individual record
end note

opt

    DigitalIdentity -> Party : 13. **TMF632 Party Mgt** GET /individual/{id}
    activate Party
    Party --> DigitalIdentity : 14. **TMF632** 200 OK (Individual)
    deactivate Party

end

note over DigitalIdentity : task 4 "Get Party Role"\nget Party record

DigitalIdentity -> PartyRoles : 15. **TMF669 Party Role Mgt** GET /partyRole/{id}
activate PartyRoles
PartyRoles --> DigitalIdentity : 16. **TMF669** 200 OK (partyRole(id,name="Alice&Bob",role="B2B Customer"))
deactivate PartyRoles

note over DigitalIdentity : task 4 "Get Party Role", completed

DigitalIdentity -> PartyInteraction : 17. **TMF701 Process Flow**\nPATCH processFlow/1/taskFlow/1.2\n(characteristic(partyRole(id,name="Alice&Bob",role="B2B Customer")))
deactivate DigitalIdentity

note over PartyInteraction : task 2 completed

note over PartyInteraction
  task 3 "User Identified. Select Next Action"
  update interaction item
  (**TMF683 Party Interaction**)
  hold
end note

PartyInteraction --> Engagement : 18. **TMF701 Process Flow**\n200 OK\n(characteristic(partyRole(id,name="Alice&Bob",role="B2B Customer"))\ncallback when information provided(processFlow.id=1,taskFlow.id=1.3\n//TaskTask Flow Information Required:\nSelect Main Offer to Configure, Sign Out, Main Page))//
deactivate PartyInteraction

Engagement --> User : 19. Present Selection

@enduml
